<title>RUSSIA: Russian harvest at 44.2 mln T bunker weight Aug 26.</title>
<headline>Russian harvest at 44.2 mln T bunker weight Aug 26.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia had harvested 58 percent of its grain crops and threshed 44.2 million tonnes bunker weight on August 26, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It released the following data,</p>
<p>				PACE OF RUSSIAN GRAIN HARVEST</p>
<p>					  AS OF AUG 26</p>
<p>				  1996    1995	  1994</p>
<p>Cut (excl. maize, in million hectares)</p>
<p>				  27.9    30.2	  20.9</p>
<p>  as pct of sown area     58	61	    42</p>
<p>Threshed</p>
<p>  (million hectares)	26.3    28.7	  17.6</p>
<p>(million tonnes, bunker weight)</p>
<p>				  44.2    41.5	  36.7</p>
<p>  as pct of sown area     55	58	    35</p>
<p>  as pct of cut area	94	95	    84</p>
<p> Yield (tonnes/hectare)   16.8    14.5	  20.9</p>
<p>--Dmitry Solovyov, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
